FILE: dto_models.py
PURPOSE: All Pydantic BaseModel and dataclass shapes used across the API boundary.
IMPORTS: dataclasses, pydantic

CLASSES:
  SearchResult (dataclass)   reply, vega_spec, insights, download_url
  SmartParserQuestion        id, label, placeholder, required
  SmartParserAnswer          id, answer
  SmartParserAnswersRequest  session_id, answers: list[SmartParserAnswer]
  ChatRequest                (fields not shown — check file)
  ChatResponse               (fields not shown — check file)
  UploadResponse             (fields not shown — check file)
